        <h2>The Bottom Line</h2>

        <p>Norway's ban on nicotine pouches is real and actively enforced. If you're a Norwegian snus user curious about pouches, you have two realistic options: travel to an EU country to try them, or continue with traditional snus, which is legal, widely available, and deeply embedded in Norwegian culture.</p>

        <p>If you do travel to the EU and try nicotine pouches, start with ZYN or Skruf (brands with Norwegian connections) and mid-strength varieties (9–11mg). Don't attempt to ship them home—the risk is not worth the reward.</p>

